      "statement": "The MCP relay client requestBrijio in servers/mcp/src/websocket-client.ts opens a new WebSocket per request, authenticates with the pairing token, sends the target envelope on auth_success, awaits the matching response or timeout, and closes the socket; there is no persistent MCP-to-relay session.",
